msgid "Fast disc loading"
msgstr "快速光碟讀取"

#: port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:358
msgid "Shorter loading screens. A few games need real disc speed."
msgstr "縮短載入畫面。少數遊戲需要實際的光碟速度。"

